    "agents": {
      "title": "agents",
      "description": "Coding-agent launchers cmux does not own. Declare a wrapper here when agents are started through it (a multi-account router, an LLM gateway front end, any \"<wrapper> run -- <agent argv>\" shim) so session restore re-supplies the wrapper instead of resuming the agent directly.",
